      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.65 (up from ₹0.15 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.12b (up 83% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹246.9m (up 421% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 22% (up from 7.8% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 97% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 58% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
